          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi baragiira ngu, omu miryango yoona, n'omuri buri ishaza, n'omuri buri rurembo bagume baijukye ebyo biro, babigire ebiro bikuru omu busingye bwona, kandi ngu ebyo biro bya Purimu, bitarihugwaho omu Bayudaaya, nari ekiijutsyo kyabyo okweba omu ruzaro rwabo.",
          "type": "text",
