        },
        {
          "text": " Ebaruha zaatwekyerwa Abayudaaya boona ab'omu mashaza igana na makumi abiri na mushanju ag'omu bugabe bwa Ahasuero, ezabaire zirimu ebigambo by'obusingye n'amazima; ",
