              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ngu zibone kuhamya ebyo biro bikuru bya Purimu omu bunaku obutairweho, nk'oku Morodekai Omuyudaaya n'omwigarire Esteeri baabiragiire Abayudaaya, bakabiragaana ahabwabo n'oruzaaro rwabo, eby'okwesiibyakwo n'amaganya gaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
